## test the driver 

1) compile the driver 
2) Load the driver using sudo insmod
3) Check the major number using cat /proc/devices | grep "my_device"
4) Unload the driver using sudo rmmod

             insmod
               │
               ▼
        module_init()
               │
               ▼
          static_init()
               │
               ▼
       Setup driver/resources


             rmmod
               │
               ▼
        module_exit()
               │
               ▼
          static_exit()
               │
               ▼
       Cleanup resources
